; The one variable: `line_length_guidelines`. Each column rules the full height under the text
; (code_edit.cpp:288-313, text_edit.cpp:1319-1322), strictly inside the band, so 0 and 400 draw
; nothing. The first column keeps full colour and later ones halve alpha (:305), so the rules at 8
; and 16 differ. Plain has no array, so an unconditional rule shows only there.

